{"full":"hf:mrfakename/minimax-h3-ultra-fast","spaceId":"mrfakename/minimax-h3-ultra-fast","name":"MiniMax-H3 Ultra Fast","source":"huggingface","description":"Ultra-fast local NVFP4 video + synchronized audio generation","category":"AI & machine learning","language":"Python","topics":["gradio","mcp-server","region:us"],"technologies":["Python"],"likes":264,"created":"2026-07-01T06:03:24.000Z","updated":"2026-09-04T18:52:17.000Z","license":null,"runtime":"RUNNING","appUrl":"https://mrfakename-minimax-h3-ultra-fast.hf.space/","demo":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/mrfakename/minimax-h3-ultra-fast","availability":"available","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-17T15:56:21.134Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-17T15:56:21.134Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-17T15:56:21.134Z","color":"#3c3250","ink":"#e4d4ff","symbol":"⚡","overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Joint video and synchronized sound from MiniMax-H3, rebuilt for a single 96 GB Blackwell ZeroGPU worker.","MiniMax-H3's published model card notes that about 13B parameters live in AdaLN-related branches and that their outputs can be precomputed for inference. The pruned checkpoint makes that concrete: it samples the shared timestep embedding curve at 1025 points and linearly interpolates an 8-value coordinate for each requested timestep. Every block's modulation projection consequently becomes [96768, 8] instead of [96768, 2688].","The four large matrices in each of the 50 blocks—fused QKV, attention output, MLP up/gate and MLP down—are NVFP4. The modulation curve, norms, embeddings, biases and final heads stay at higher precision."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/mrfakename/minimax-h3-ultra-fast/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"ad22c276a7fa211158344902fa201171b917e88ed40fee216e3fff67fc05bce4","extractedAt":"2026-10-04T08:14:55.475Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-17T15:56:21.222Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Joint video and synchronized sound from MiniMax-H3, rebuil